  "operative_text": "Section 571.111 (RSMo): 6. A firearms safety instructor shall be considered to be a qualified firearms safety instructor by any sheriff issuing a concealed carry permit pursuant to sections 571.101 to 571.121 if the instructor: (5) Is a certified police officer firearms safety instructor; or (6) Is a valid firearms instructor certified by the United States Concealed Carry Association (USCCA)."
